OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FStaying mostly dry on Tuesday, before
OL,7,Frain bands and showers move in
OL,8,Fmidweek. Some heavy, thundery rain is
OL,9,Fpossible, with warmer, more humid
OL,10,Fconditions for a time.
